Use the **`tools`** config when creating the session and give an `enable` list for the `github` toolkit. Only the listed actions will be available; all other GitHub tools are hidden.

**Python**

```python
session = composio.sessions.create(
    user_id="user_123",
    tools={
        "github": {"enable": ["GITHUB_CREATE_ISSUE", "GITHUB_GET_ISSUE"]},
